{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1251.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"5f04ce6f97d15e56f5e286df6fc0e3d3ac2e5b01453cf108ae9b9949bf04cf71","ja":"結婚に関するアンケート","zh":"婚姻相关问卷","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1251.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"666098982bc744604fcd23126311f76256d4115e0009a35b88dd4185f11e1dad","ja":"「趣向を凝らしたオリジナルウェディング」\n「ふたりだけの特別な式」……。","zh":"“别出心裁的独创婚礼”\n“仅属于两人的特别仪式”……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1251.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"d57660a3d62d2cdd564a985fea298b86ef9f08d9fcfac36138f9d4df87a73e3e","ja":"結婚式場のパンフレットには、みなさんの夢が\nたくさんつまっていますね……うっとり。","zh":"婚礼殿堂的宣传册里，装满了大家的\n无数梦想呢……真是令人陶醉。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1251.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"768d61392110e43a48c5a6fd7e1816304f6132bc7fe3c28be57432e3d6e9401e","ja":"結婚式場のお仕事は終わったのに、ついつい、\nいろんなページを眺めてしまいますね～♪","zh":"明明在婚礼会场的工作已经结束了，却还是忍不住\n翻看着各种页面呢～♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1251.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"5cee494f298f0ceb2afba70c3d71a02fff07ec236146fcb59594599724d1a41f","ja":"本当は、お仕事の資料をかたづけるはずだったのにね！\n……あれ？","zh":"本来明明是打算整理工作资料的呢！\n……咦？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1251.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"027324dfa20c4f3d21d0328841a775f8c788e860a16e1340b7752467cf7e284c","ja":"このパンフレット、前に自分たちが\n答えたのと同じようなアンケートが載ってるぞ！","zh":"这份宣传册上，登着和我们之前\n回答过的很像的问卷调查呢！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1251.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"f429c2a3741ae59e9a5ed393f8f41b422e4ad4ea997f4e0f29d0ef4ad3d780bb","ja":"ほんとだ！　実際に結婚した人たちが答えてるんだね。\n「結婚式は国内と国外、どっちだった？」とか……。","zh":"真的耶！原来是实际结了婚的人回答的呀。\n比如“婚礼是在国内还是在国外办的？”之类的……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1251.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"d434294d1f7808ce9ac949f31432590227417caf7d99094b92317b652d6b6c18","ja":"あ、「ハネムーンも兼ねて国外！　現地のマラソン大会\nにも夫婦で出場！」って人がいるよ！　楽しそ～！","zh":"啊，有人说“顺便度蜜月所以去国外！夫妻俩还\n参加了当地的马拉松比赛！”呢！看起来好好玩～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1251.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"9e90e498a796efd0f362deb7b6a92257fb82332d495c4cd826faa48f3b4a820f","ja":"ふたりの好きなこと一緒にやれて、\nめっちゃええやん♪　他にも面白そうなんが……ん？","zh":"能一起做两个人喜欢的事，\n真是太棒了♪ 其他看起来挺有意思的……嗯？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1251.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"a3c91f57180ccbaefbc7147fe7d37d0517738693348d6737df53938a54d9de90","ja":"ちょ、みんなここ見てくれへん！","zh":"等、大家都不看这里啊！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1251.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"444a06cf306a62c29cf52500ff1bbd11276f78f4c64065cb73ac7a3b2d28af68","ja":"なになに～？\n「あなたが結婚相手に出会った時期はいつ？」……。","zh":"什么什么～？\n“你是什么时候遇到结婚对象的？”……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1251.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"06672721aa5f74525d0d7dc066bae4c8ac3f65586241439b2a8237cc69d40033","ja":"えっ、『学生時代』って人が\n30パーセントもいるの！？","zh":"咦，选“学生时代”的人居然有30%之多吗！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
